WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.933
Watch and read: Ama asks: What is the purpose of a recipe?

00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:09.754
The answer is: explain how to cook. Different kinds of texts have different purposes.

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:15.417
Watch and read: For your storyparts practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:15.417 --> 00:00:20.217
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:20.217 --> 00:00:20.537
character?

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:25.484
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.
